	"img": "systems/a5e/assets/Mask_of_the_Desert_Nomad.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>This mask’s surface looks like red cracked clay, with golden inserts within the cracks. It bestows the resilience of an expert desert dweller upon the wearer: Fatigue or Strife caused by extreme heat will not affect the wearer, no matter their carrying capacity, unless they wear heavy armour, in which case they will make the Saving Throw with advantage.</p><p>Furthermore, the wearer’s skin will not be affected by sunburn.</p>",
